1
00:00:00,720 --> 00:00:02,970
(Leonard:)- Sheldon, we have to do this.
- No, we don't.

2
00:00:03,139 --> 00:00:05,349
(Sheldon:)We have to take in nourishment,
expel waste...

3
00:00:05,516 --> 00:00:08,146
(Sheldon:)...and inhale enough oxygen
to keep our cells from dying.

4
00:00:08,311 --> 00:00:10,311
(Sheldon:)Everything else is optional.

5
00:00:10,479 --> 00:00:12,569
Okay, let me put it this way: I'm doing it.

6
00:00:12,732 --> 00:00:14,812
(Sheldon:)You can't. I'm the lead author.

7
00:00:14,984 --> 00:00:18,774
(Leonard:)Come on, the only reason you're the lead
author is because we went alphabetically.

8
00:00:18,946 --> 00:00:20,866
(Sheldon:)I let you think we went alphabetically...

9
00:00:21,032 --> 00:00:23,822
...to spare you dealing
with the fact that it was my idea.

10
00:00:23,993 --> 00:00:27,493
(Sheldon:)Not to put too fine a point on it,
but I was throwing you a bone.

11
00:00:27,913 --> 00:00:29,243
(Sheldon:)You're welcome.

12
00:00:29,415 --> 00:00:32,835
(Leonard:)Excuse me, I designed the experiment
that proved the hypothesis.

13
00:00:33,002 --> 00:00:34,422
(Sheldon:)It doesn't need proving.

14
00:00:34,587 --> 00:00:38,337
(Leonard:)So the entire scientific community
is just supposed to just take your word?

15
00:00:38,507 --> 00:00:41,257
(Sheldon:)They're not supposed to,
but they should.

16
00:00:41,427 --> 00:00:42,637
(Leonard:)I don't care what you say.

17
00:00:42,803 --> 00:00:45,263
(Leonard:)I'm going to the conference,
presenting our findings.

18
00:00:45,431 --> 00:00:46,601
(Sheldon:)And I forbid it.

19
00:00:48,142 --> 00:00:49,352
(Leonard:)You forbid it?

20
00:00:49,518 --> 00:00:52,398
(Sheldon:)If I'm not taking credit for our work,
then nobody is.

21
00:00:52,563 --> 00:00:57,153
- So you admit that it's our work?
- No, once again, I'm throwing you a bone.

22
00:00:57,318 --> 00:01:00,018
(Sheldon:)And once again, you are welcome.

